# FIELD-GRASS-FAR: the field's blades reach 60 m (start thinning at 20 m) and the meshes 80 m; a thinned-out blade
# widens by 1/sqrt(share) so the cover holds, and shrinks only over the last 20 % (owner 10-28: "the field looks 2000s").
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first lower third of the frame: a solid cover of blades
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,350,2500
Тогда-вид 2_low grass solid out to 30 m, thinning smoothly beyond, no visible edge
